{"ID":"20240522082311-bbi9roj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082311-bbi9roj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082311-bbi9roj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082311-k9rd01k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082311-k9rd01k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082311-k9rd01k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"張孟超醫師的十棗湯案例之二","type":"doc","updated":"20240522083549"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522082831-pv1mp2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-pv1mp2l","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十棗湯案例【二】懸飲／支飲"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-o4n7aia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-o4n7aia","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"＜金匱＞疾飲咳嗽病第十二："}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-bbk8y7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-bbk8y7w","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.飲後水流在脅下，欬唾引痛，謂之懸飲；咳逆倚息，不得臥，其形如腫，謂之支飲。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-vxoaaep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-vxoaaep","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.脈浮而細滑，傷飲。脈弦數，有寒飲，冬夏難治。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-gb28fqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-gb28fqr","updated":"20240522082853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈沈而弦者，懸飲內痛。病懸飲者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-0vzk1t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-0vzk1t3","updated":"20240522082856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.咳家其脈弦，為有水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-w6io9o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-w6io9o0","updated":"20240522082859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.夫有支飲家，咳煩，胸中痛者，不卒死，至一百日或一歲，宜"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-lr62ak8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-lr62ak8","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"＜傷寒＞167條："}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-vf9dgam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-vf9dgam","updated":"20240522082905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「太陽中風」，下利，嘔逆，表解者，乃可攻之；其人漐漐汗出，發作有時，頭痛，心下痞鞭滿，引脅下痛，嘔即短氣，汗出不惡寒者，此表解裡未和也，「"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-h0e5fje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-h0e5fje","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎4-18-2008初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-yr4quzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-yr4quzo","updated":"20240522082911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"L.T.， 65歲，男性（很熟的老病號），當我走進診室，發現一人裹著毛毯，踡臥在診療床上，打著哆嗦，直喊：我全身酸痛、發燒，快死啦！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我答道：不過是太陽表證，死不了啦，您老愛開玩笑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-cpvatel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-cpvatel","updated":"20240522082945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"問道：怕冷嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"會。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-5ccluzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-5ccluzq","updated":"20240522082949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"流汗嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-276dthj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-276dthj","updated":"20240522082956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不怎麼渴。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喝冷水舒服還是溫水舒服？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熱水"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-i87jsmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-i87jsmz","updated":"20240522083001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有咳嗽或喉痛鼻涕之類的症狀嗎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只有早晨起來有白痰、流鼻水。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-j59o760","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-j59o760","updated":"20240522083529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再問：胃口如何？胃口不好，有點噁心。而且頭暈、頭重腳輕。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（心想，已兼有少陽症候了。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-86c8aav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-86c8aav","updated":"20240522083008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"追問：您發燒是一直燒還是忽冷忽熱？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是呀，你怎麼知道我忽冷忽熱？"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-qc7z4yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-qc7z4yg","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下舌診：苔白厚而膩。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-uuy61zt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-uuy61zt","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：右寸浮滑有力，左脈弦。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-cjk59l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-cjk59l2","updated":"20240522083017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此乃痰飲之人，太陽少陽兼證，我開立處方：【柴胡桂枝湯，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師特別叮嚀加重柴胡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）、再加厚朴、杏仁】。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-ks0xgxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-ks0xgxa","updated":"20240522083534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎4-24-2008複診第一次"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（這麼久才回診，我還以為早好了）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-a0ez9tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-a0ez9tr","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人自訴現下已無惡寒之症，有汗，不喜吹到風，鼻中感到酸而乾，咳嗽，痰白稀，躺下咳甚，有氣上衝感。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-yegbfs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-yegbfs8","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下舌診：苔淡黃而膩。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-px55myi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-px55myi","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：右寸滑，左脈弦。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-r4lxduu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-r4lxduu","updated":"20240522083536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少陽已解，痰飲重，表虛。於是處方：【桂枝湯，加黃耆、制南星、半夏、黃芩及通鼻竅藥】。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（事後回想，似乎射干麻黃湯較為對證）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-s899xb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-s899xb4","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎4-25-2008複診第二次"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-6ti5qwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-6ti5qwx","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病情轉劇，病人咳甚、痰多、已但坐不能臥，躺左側咳更甚。自覺胸中，從喉頭到心下，透到背部，有一長方形物梗到，呼吸困難。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-6y3c1o7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-6y3c1o7","updated":"20240522083543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下舌診：舌苔根部白厚膩。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"多例十棗湯證舌診皆有此現象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，足証倪師所言甚是，舌根部乃為上焦，創古人所未見。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-jc9l1bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-jc9l1bm","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：雙脈弦滑。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-efbk728","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-efbk728","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：胸肋間隙叩診，悶濁而非清亮鼓音。左脅苦滿。心下微痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-drjxiw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-drjxiw5","updated":"20240522083036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診：肺白區有明顯痰飲，在肺肝交界區。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師絕活"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-slqolw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-slqolw9","updated":"20240522083549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳診：（忘了查）（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"其實問診完已經可以確診，後面診查，只為了確認無誤，及印證"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恩師所言。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-9276o1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-9276o1i","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方：【十棗湯生用4.5克，紅棗粉10克，清晨空腹服】一劑，以峻下逐水。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-my1zum6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-my1zum6","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   4-26-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-1muumv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-1muumv4","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    詢問得知：早上8點服藥後，11點開始反胃、腹絞痛，吐大量白色泡沬痰，鼻涕眼淚齊下，汗出，十分鐘後，又吐又拉幾乎同時，拉出許多水，但吐已較少，約莫下午2點結束。共歷六小時。當晚即能躺下睡覺，只剩輕微咳嗽。病人告訴我，下回免費請他，他也不吃！"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-us02oaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-us02oaa","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後記："}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-j8k6psc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-j8k6psc","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此後以苓桂朮甘湯加減，以除去水飲病根，最後用鳥梅丸，苦溫化濕法痊癒。另外有趣的事，病人近日血液檢查（病人有B型肝炎），血小板從30升到120（標準值是140），而且以前易瘀青的毛病，也消失了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-k07qjzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-k07qjzp","updated":"20240522082842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6-26-2008 "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生孟超報告到此，感謝恩師傳授點石之術，而非贈與成金。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-1ejzojv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-1ejzojv","updated":"20240522082836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我這位孟超學生實很優秀，真是天資聰敏過人，將來必成大器，老師很高興有這位傑出的學生進入本門，其經方的功力是與日俱增。"}]},{"ID":"20240522082831-2o6g03g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082831-2o6g03g","updated":"20240522082831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈 謹記於台北07/04/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522082832-15pbzhv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522082832-15pbzhv"}},{"ID":"20240522082833-okjzlvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082833-okjzlvc"}}]}